---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Islam and you" description="Guides to Islam for Christians, people close to Buddhism, and people with no religion." lang="en">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Islam and you</h1>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width:620px">Everyone starts understanding Islam from a different place. Pick the path closest to you. None of them puts down another religion; each sets out what we share and where we differ, as they are.</p>
    <div class="grid" style="margin-top:24px">
      <a class="card card-link" href="/en/you/christian/"><h3>I'm a Christian</h3><p>For Protestants and Catholics. The same God, Jesus and Mary, the Bible and the Qur'an.</p></a>
      <a class="card card-link" href="/en/you/buddhist/"><h3>I'm close to Buddhism</h3><p>Where Buddhism, which speaks of no creator God, meets Islam, which believes in one God.</p></a>
      <a class="card card-link" href="/en/you/non-religious/"><h3>I'm not religious</h3><p>A no-pressure conversation for people who keep religion at a distance.</p></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
